# FINAL RECOMMENDATION

Radiology / Imaging system ke liye ek common application rakho, lekin har role ko uske kaam ke according dashboard, menus, work queues aur actions do.

**Core roles:** Admin, Receptionist, Scheduler, Technician, Radiologist, Billing Executive aur Cashier.

**Advanced roles:** PACS Administrator, Quality Manager, Equipment Manager, Inventory Manager, Insurance Executive, Accountant aur IT Administrator.

**External roles:** Referring Doctor aur Patient Portal.

Aise banane se MRI, X-Ray, CT Scan, Ultrasound, Doppler aur Mammography ke workflows ek Radiology / Imaging module mein manage honge, lekin har role ka access aur responsibility clearly separate rahegi.